<h1>global optimum</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
The best possible solution to a problem.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="localoptimum.html"><em>local optimum</em></a>, <a href="optimization.html"><em>optimization problem</em></a>, <a href="prisonersDilemma.html"><em>prisoner's dilemma</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
Some search methods may get trapped in a <a href="localoptimum.html"><em>local optimum</em></a> and miss the global optimum.</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

